{
    "title": "Thrillzz Social Sportsbook",
    "description": "Thrillzz: Your Ticket to Sports Predictions & Social Competition!\r\n\r\nUnlike traditional sports betting, Thrillzz Social Sportsbook lets you experience the thrill of sports betting risk-free. Make predictions on your favorite sports, compete with friends, & climb the leaderboards - all for free!\r\n\r\nMake NFL bets, college football bets, football pickems, NFL pickems & more!\r\n\r\nWhat is Thrillzz?\r\n\r\nMake sports picks in a social sportsbook & climb the leaderboards!\r\n\r\nCreate Squads with friends & compete for bragging rights in a unique social sportsbook.\r\n\r\nExperience the excitement of a free-to-play sportsbook featuring premier leagues from NBA basketball, NFL football, NCAA college football. MLB baseball, NHL hockey, MLS soccer & more!\r\n\r\nUnlock daily log-in rewards, gain loyalty levels & enjoy a thrilling gaming experience. Unleash your predictive prowess & go up the social betting rankings. Navigate our user-friendly sportsbook effortlessly for a seamless free picks process.\r\n\r\nInvite friends into the action & get free picks or celebrate with your Squad when your football predictions strike gold!\r\n\r\nHere's what makes Thrillzz the ultimate sports & football pick'em companion app:\r\n\r\nFree-to-play Sports Predictions: Dive into the world of sports predictions & sweepstakes without spending a dime. Test your knowledge with free picks on a variety of sports & leagues, from NFL football & NBA basketball to MLB baseball and NHL hockey. Hone your skills & see if you can become the ultimate sports predictor!\r\n\r\nIn-Play Excitement: Predict the action on the widest range of sporting events, with more in-play picks than any other sportsbook app. Live stats and graphics make the Thrillzz app your must-have companion for watching live sports.\r\n\r\nThrilling Promotions & Rewards: Every correct pick you make in the Thrillzz Social Sportsbook earns you points & free bets. You will also earn free picks daily for logging in & spinning the wheel! These points unlock exciting rewards & give you a chance to win big on prizes! No matter your sports knowledge level, everyone has a shot at winning free bets & picks.\r\n\r\nSocial Gaming Experience: Sports betting & predictions are more fun with friends! Thrillzz adds a whole new level of excitement to your favorite sports by allowing you to compete with friends. Share your picks, challenge each other & see who emerges as the sports prediction champion!\r\n\r\nFair & Safe Platform: At Thrillzz, we prioritize fairness & safety above all else. Our platform is designed with transparency in mind, ensuring every player has an equal chance to win. We provide a secure & fun environment where you can enjoy the thrill of sports predictions without any worries.\r\n\r\nDaily Bonuses & Rewards: The fun doesn't stop at making sweepstakes predictions! Thrillzz rewards you for your engagement with daily bonuses & free bets. Earn points to enhance your betting experience. Use your points to make predictions & share bets with friends. Watch your rewards increase as you progress through levels.\r\n\r\nPromotions: offered through the Thrillzz app are sponsored & administered by Thrillzz, Inc. only. Google is not involved in any way. No purchase is required to play.\r\n\r\nThrillzz is for fun & entertainment! It provides a simulated gaming experience for adults. Playing social sports games on Thrillzz doesn't mean you'll be successful at real money gaming.\r\n\r\nThrillzz offers only a simulated gaming experience intended for an adult audience ages 18+ in 36/50 states, excluding: Alabama, Georgia, Idaho, Indiana, Iowa, Kentucky, Louisiana, Michigan, Minnesota, Mississippi, Nevada, Ohio, and South Carolina, and Washington.\r\n\r\nThere is no real money gaming offered in the app. It is free to play and no purchase is required. Play, practice or success at social sportsbook sweepstakes gaming free to play app does not imply future success at real money gaming.\r\n\r\nDownload Thrillzz today & unlock a world of free-to-play sports sweepstakes, social betting & the chance to win big prizes!",
